    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-193" contextRef="c-20">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style="margin-bottom: 0"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nature of Operations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.5in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;The respondent operates a high pressure natural gas transmission line in the Northern DJ Basin consisting of approximately 16 miles of 6&amp;quot; steel and 14 miles of 8&amp;quot; steel. The pipeline extends from Laramie County WY to northern Weld County CO, of which approximately 26 miles are located in WY and 4 miles in CO.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.5in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol start="2" style="margin-bottom: 0"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.5in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;The respondent is organized as a limited liability company and taxed as a partnership for federal income tax purposes. As a result, income or losses are taxable or deductible to the members rather than at the respondent level; accordingly, no provision has been made for federal income taxes in the accompanying financial statements. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.5in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol start="3" style="margin-bottom: 0"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Allocated expenses&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 8pt 0.5in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;All expenses are allocated from parent entity, Roaring Fork Midstream, LLC.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 8pt 0.5in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
